  "interpretation": "<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"prose text-pretty dark:prose-invert inline leading-normal break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word]\">\n<div class=\"group relative\">\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"mb-xs mt-5 text-base font-[500] first:mt-0 dark:font-[475]\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Reference Ranges</span></h2>\n<div class=\"group relative\">\n<div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto md:max-w-[90vw] border-borderMain/50 ring-borderMain/50 divide-borderMain/50 dark:divide-borderMainDark/50 dark:ring-borderMainDark/50 dark:border-borderMainDark/50 bg-transparent\">\n<table class=\"border-borderMain my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\" style=\"width: 92.2035%; height: 219.767px;\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset\">\n<tr style=\"height: 53.7951px;\">\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Group</span></th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Reference Range (pg/mL)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.1944px;\">\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Adult Female (follicular phase)</span></td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">20&ndash;350</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.1944px;\">\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Adult Female (midcycle peak)</span></td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">150&ndash;750</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.1944px;\">\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Adult Female (luteal phase)</span></td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">30&ndash;450</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.1944px;\">\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Adult Female (postmenopausal)</span></td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">0&ndash;30</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.1944px;\">\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 53.9509%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Adult Male</span></td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\" style=\"width: 46.0315%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">10&ndash;50</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 font-medium gap-1 justify-center\">\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center size-3.5\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Elevated Oestrogen Levels:</strong> May indicate estrogen-producing tumors, hyperthyroidism, cirrhosis, early puberty, or pregnancy. In males, elevated values may be associated with testicular tumors or feminizing disorders.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Decreased Oestrogen Levels:</strong> Could be due to primary ovarian insufficiency, hypopituitarism, menopause, or Turner syndrome.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Results must be interpreted in conjunction with clinical context and other laboratory findings. Dynamic monitoring or additional hormone panels may be required for comprehensive assessment<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">.</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
